--TEST--
`prepareRename` on a `Core` attribute's name is refused with the name it resolved to, because a `Core` class is declared outside the workspace, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Blog
{
    #[Core\Ro<|>ute(path: "/", method: Core\Http\Method::Get)]
    public static function index(): string
    {
        return "hello";
    }
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: `Core\Route` is declared outside this workspace, so it cannot be renamed.
